# Content Modeling

- Portfolio body blocks use semantic names: `imageGallery`, `singleMedia`, `cloudinaryAlbumRef`, `pullQuote`, `projectFacts`, `projectMetrics`, `prototypeEmbed`, `twoColumnEditorial`, `beforeAfterComparison`.
- Cloudinary assets store `publicId`, `alt`, and optional `caption` — never API secrets.
- `siteSettings` is a singleton document affecting layout and global metadata.
- Content-driven pages remain data-driven; do not invent placeholder portfolio entries in production code paths.
- When adding fields, update queries, types in `src/types`, and fetch mappers together.
